  "version": "HL7 v2.4",
  "chapter": "Financial Management",
  "description": "The P06 event is a notification that the account is no longer open, that is, no new charges can accrue to this account.  This notification is not related to whether or not the account is paid in full.  EVN-2 - recorded date/time must contain the account end date.\n\nNote: P07-P09 have been defined by the Orders/Observations Technical Committee as product experience messages.",
